    "text": "You may have the sense of awareness coming and going, and of somehow losing awareness when you get caught up, lost in thought, and then recovering it in some way when you come back. And this way we miss the constancy of awareness. But like right now, you're aware. Could you turn it off even if you wanted to? Give it a try. Just for a moment now, for the next few seconds, try not to be aware.",
